~ start
Danilo: What was that dream?
Danilo: ...
Danilo: Oh, it's raining... after all.
Danilo: It feels... heavier than it should.  
do Hud.show_objectives()
#do Player.looked_window = true
=> END

~ phone_time
do player_danilo.can_move = false
Danilo: Too early... Way too early for this.  
Danilo: My head... it feels... foggy.  
do player_danilo.can_move = true
do ObjectiveManager.complete_objective(2)
do get_tree().create_timer(1).timeout
do add_notification()
=> reminder
=> END

~ reminder
do player_danilo.can_move = false
Danilo: Today... again.  
do tension_in_anim()
Danilo: Another anniversary of [wave][color=#8B0000][i]his[/i][/color][/wave] disappearance.
Danilo: Every year it feels... heavier... 
do tension_out_anim()
do Hud.phone_outro()
=> go_bed
do player_danilo.can_move = true
=> END

~ go_bed
Danilo: I can’t stay awake... I need to... just sleep.  
Danilo: I still have plans later.
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(scene_objectives[2]["ID"], scene_objectives[2]["text"])
do activate_bed()
=> END!

~ water
Danilo: Maybe water... might help... maybe not...  
do drink_water_anim()
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(scene_objectives[1]["ID"], scene_objectives[1]["text"])
#do Player.drank_water = true
do get_tree().create_timer(2).timeout
do Hud.phone_intro()
do Hud.get_node("Control/phone/MarginContainer/lock_screen/Panel/lock").disabled = true
=> phone_time
=> END
